WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:02.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Halloween´s coming up --
your family, I know,

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
takes it very seriously.
-Very seriously.

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:05.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I just wanted --
We have some photos to show

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.040 size:75% position:38%
how serious you are.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
Full "Star Wars" theme --
that´s brilliant.

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:10.877
-Wait a minute, full "Star Wars"

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:13.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
until the last minute when
August said,

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You know what,
I want to be Darth Vader."

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:16.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, really?

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:17.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I went, "Sweetie,
we have a theme."

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said, "I want to be
Darth Vader."

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:21.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Really?
What was he supposed to be?

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:23.189
-I don´t know, one of those
little guys from the movie.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, okay.

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:25.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, little,
cute little guys.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.293
-Oh, cute little, like an Ewok?
-Like, yeah.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:28.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, okay.
Well, look, it still works.

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
You didn´t have to
ruin it for me.

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:31.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:34.034
But then that was when you just
had one kid and that´s easy.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And now you fully --

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:38.438
now you got -- There´s five of
you, so they go "Incredibles."

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:39.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
Fantastic.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:42.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is some Day of the Dead
stuff there.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yep!
-Look very good.

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:46.880
That -- look at you guys!

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s "Inside Out."
-"Inside Out" family photo.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was Joy.
-Yeah, that´s great.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:55.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He was sadness, anger --
-Yeah.

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:56.823 size:84% position:42%
-Can you figure it out?

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, he´s very good,
he´s very intense.

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:00.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
How´d you get his hair
like that?

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:01.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s great.
-It´s amazing what we do.

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:02.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have a team
to put this together.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.164 size:78% position:39%
-Yeah. And do they --

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:06.666
Do you chose as a -- Do the five
of you chose together?

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:09.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We do, the kids
sort of determine.

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:11.137
Yeah, they -- they call it.

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:13.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is there a spoiler alert
element to this or --

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:14.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can you tell me
what you´re gonna be?

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:15.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, I can´t.
I can´t be the betrayer.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.543 size:81% position:41%
-Oh, you can´t tell us
what you´re gonna be.

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:17.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, no, no, no,
I´m sworn to secrecy.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:19.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Gotcha.
When do you guys lock it down?

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:20.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
When did you know
what you´re gonna be?

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:21.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, we just locked it --
I´ll tell you,

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:24.451
Peter was pitching a few ideas,
which I liked better.

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:27.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
He wanted to be, can I say?
-You can say, what --

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He wanted to be
a bouquet of flowers.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The whole family was a --
-The whole family,

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:32.759
each a different flower, which I
thought was so beautiful.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:34.427
-Yeah, I think that´s a --
I think it´s a dud, yeah.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:35.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
-August is like --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Ahh! Ahh! No."
-Yeah.

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:39.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, he just shut that down.
-First of all, I just --

00:01:39.466 --> 00:01:40.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like
as a bouquet of flower,

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.902
you guys have to sort of shuffle
down the street together.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But we do anyway.
-Yeah.

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:47.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think as a kid --
how old´s August now?

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:49.175 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He´s 11.
-Yeah, so he´s like --

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:50.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
he wants to be able to
break away,

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
maybe at some point, you know.
-Yeah. I´m not ready!

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.581
-Especially if you shamed him
for the Darth Vader thing,

00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:56.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m sure he´s like,
"I don´t know."

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:58.151
-Well, it´s just that he´s
changing at the last minute.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:01:59.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank God I had
like four more outfits.

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:01.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But, like, everything´s
locked down and ready to go?

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:02.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, it´s locked down.
We´re ready to go.

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:05.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
Usually, you know, beginning
of October, we´re good.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, that´s great.
-Yeah, no, we prep.

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:10.163
-I also want to ask about this,
you are a "Hamilton" superfan

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:11.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a lot of people
would say that

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:12.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
they are the biggest fan of
"Hamilton,"

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:14.968
but you actually maybe have

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:17.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
a case to be made
that this is true.

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:19.172
You did the audiobook for Lin.

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:21.841
So Lin came to you. He knew that
you were intensely involved.

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:24.043
-He did.
-How many times did you see it?

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:26.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I´ve seen it 15 times.
-15 times!

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:28.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
That´s incredible.

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:30.116 size:75% position:38%
-And I´m going again

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:32.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
because as you said in
the beginning of the show,

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:35.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
now, you know, we have guest
stars coming on the show.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:39.125
-Yeah. Oh, so you take --
you like to take people.

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:41.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, no, but the guest star
is playing --

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:43.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, of course!
-Right?

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
So they come on the show
and then I need to see them.

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:46.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-In it.

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:48.101
The new cast and they just blow
my mind.

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:49.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was sort of one of
the famous things

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:50.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
about "Law and Order"
over the years

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:52.205 align:start size:94% position:6%
because it shoots in New York.
-Yeah.

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:54.574
-All the "Law and Orders" always
have fantastic Broadway actors.

00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:56.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is the greatest part
of my job.

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:57.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And that´s what you guys did
in 19 seasons,

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:00.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
so you could pay for 15 trips
to "Hamilton."

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:02.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-How do you think I did it?

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:05.752
Why do you think I´m gonna do it
for another two years?

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:08.054 size:88% position:44%
-Exactly! And how was it
recording the audiobook?

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:09.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was it exciting?
-It was so exciting.

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:12.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had just finished directing
and I --

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:13.593
Actually, when he asked me,

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:16.796
I was just about to go into
directing and I was like,

00:03:16.796 --> 00:03:18.331
"Ahh! How am I gonna do this?"

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:21.901
But when Lin calls you and says,
"Will you do the audiobook?"

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:24.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
you sort of --
I was so happy and I --

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
I sort of stayed up all night,
you know, rehearsing

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:28.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
and rereading
because you want to honor it.

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:30.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, of course.
-And I was --

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:32.011 align:start size:94% position:6%
So one of the great honors
of my life.

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:33.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, well, that´s great.
-Truly.

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:34.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, congratulations.
-That´s so wonderful to hear.

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:36.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
And always such a honor
to have you here.

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:37.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much, Mariska.
-Thank you!

